Not this time.

263
00:21:15,010 --> 00:21:18,370
Maybe this is the sign I
should just call it quits.

264
00:21:23,090 --> 00:21:24,490
This is Rick and all.

265
00:21:24,950 --> 00:21:26,910
I am killing it, I am.

266
00:21:29,410 --> 00:21:32,470
Dragon Twister Demolition Brass.

267
00:21:43,590 --> 00:21:45,550
He is all over the place.

268
00:21:47,510 --> 00:21:50,490
No, I'm done. I'm done. Leave me alone.

269
00:21:54,170 --> 00:21:56,750
Oh, where the hell are you going?

270
00:21:57,150 --> 00:21:58,090
Far away!

271
00:21:58,630 --> 00:21:59,550
I'm useless!

272
00:21:59,970 --> 00:22:02,029
Everything I've done turns to crap!

273
00:22:17,010 --> 00:22:19,990
I need to be alone right now!

274
00:22:20,770 --> 00:22:22,210
Don't look at me!

275
00:22:28,630 --> 00:22:30,983
Sorry, but it's too late for you to cry!

276
00:22:33,310 --> 00:22:35,410
You don't want to leave me alone?

277
00:22:36,030 --> 00:22:36,860
Enter!

278
00:22:37,650 --> 00:22:38,480
Enter!

279
00:22:40,090 --> 00:22:40,920
Magua!

280
00:22:50,110 --> 00:22:52,370
OK, you truck, take that!

281
00:22:57,590 --> 00:22:58,420
Ah!

282
00:23:30,450 --> 00:23:32,610
His Haki keeps getting stronger!

283
00:23:34,570 --> 00:23:37,010
I like getting drunk, okay?

284
00:23:39,710 --> 00:23:42,030
Stop trying this over me!

285
00:23:49,990 --> 00:23:50,820
Oh!

286
00:24:04,990 --> 00:24:06,330
Come on!

287
00:24:08,570 --> 00:24:09,990
Kunda-lis!

288
00:24:12,210 --> 00:24:14,010
Rock-at-lis!

289
00:24:14,870 --> 00:24:16,350
Magnet-sword!

290
00:24:21,570 --> 00:24:22,400
No!

291
00:24:32,230 --> 00:24:33,630
No!

292
00:24:34,050 --> 00:24:35,150
Help me!

293
00:24:37,410 --> 00:24:38,240
No!

294
00:24:42,790 --> 00:24:43,620
No!

295
00:24:43,703 --> 00:24:45,090
No!

296
00:24:49,990 --> 00:24:51,147
What?!

297
00:24:51,230 --> 00:24:52,670
No!

298
00:24:54,050 --> 00:24:54,880
No!

299
00:24:56,370 --> 00:24:57,200
No!

300
00:25:18,450 --> 00:25:21,730
This year's reverie has
been a cursed affair.

301
00:25:22,410 --> 00:25:25,887
The Seven Warlords of the
Sea program was abolished.

302
00:25:25,970 --> 00:25:29,267
The situation with Alabasta
was most unfortunate,

303
00:25:29,350 --> 00:25:32,990
and the Revolutionary Army
invaded the Holy Land.

304
00:25:33,250 --> 00:25:35,450
There's no point in lamenting it now.

305
00:25:36,230 --> 00:25:39,950
Indeed, the land of Wano is
our most pressing concern.

306
00:25:40,290 --> 00:25:44,250
This battle has certainly had more
twists and turns than expected.

307
00:25:44,530 --> 00:25:46,824
This is our best opportunity to strike.

308
00:25:47,110 --> 00:25:48,410
We can't delay.

309
00:25:48,770 --> 00:25:50,747
They'll catch Nico Robbins somehow.

310
00:25:50,830 --> 00:25:54,407
With Kaido and Big Mom there,
death could come for anyone.

311
00:25:54,490 --> 00:25:57,230
It's an excuse to wipe
out our inconveniences.

312
00:25:57,610 --> 00:25:59,250
We will erase them all.

313
00:25:59,630 --> 00:26:01,190
And most importantly,

314
00:26:01,470 --> 00:26:05,411
we'll erase the existence of that
Devil Fruit before it's too late.

315
00:26:11,790 --> 00:26:14,547
Maintain combat readiness
until further notice.

316
00:26:14,630 --> 00:26:16,510
All ships remain on standby.

317
00:26:30,750 --> 00:26:31,910
Uh, sir?

318
00:26:32,250 --> 00:26:33,110
What is it?

319
00:26:34,030 --> 00:26:34,860
Not sure.

320
00:26:35,370 --> 00:26:39,110
It looks like a giant shadow. A shadow?

321
00:26:39,370 --> 00:26:40,470
What do you mean?

322
00:26:41,110 --> 00:26:43,770
I have no idea, sir. What?

323
00:26:44,130 --> 00:26:45,690
We'll figure it out!

324
00:26:46,690 --> 00:26:48,490
It's an island.

325
00:26:49,710 --> 00:26:51,790
No, it's unthinkable.

326
00:26:52,030 --> 00:26:53,971
Even to those who know the truth.

327
00:26:54,490 --> 00:26:56,549
It's hardly more than a legend now.

328
00:26:58,270 --> 00:27:00,410
It hasn't awakened for centuries.

329
00:27:00,770 --> 00:27:03,190
You think we still have cause to fear it?

330
00:27:03,290 --> 00:27:05,627
The world government gave it another name.

331
00:27:05,710 --> 00:27:07,927
That is proof that the fruit is a threat.

332
00:27:08,010 --> 00:27:11,186
There's only one reason
someone would do such a thing.

333
00:27:17,790 --> 00:27:22,450
To hide its name from
history, it must be erased.
